  ],
  "description": "Operating Area: Caribbean (BVI, US Virgin Islands, Leeward Islands)\n\nSolaire means “of the sun.” This perfectly captures the spirit of this 55-foot power catamaran. Designed to celebrate sunshine and space, Solaire offers an exceptional on-water experience centered around expansive outdoor living and seamless comfort. With wide, stable decks and multiple sun pads positioned for all day lounging, guests are invited to fully embrace the warmth and open views of island cruising.\n\nAt anchor, Solaire becomes a true floating playground. Guests can step directly into clear, inviting waters, explore vibrant reefs with an impressive selection of water toys, or enjoy the thrill of the onboard slide, a standout feature that delights guests of all ages. Whether snorkeling, paddleboarding, or simply floating beneath the sun, every moment is designed for both adventure and relaxation.\n\nBetween adventures, Solaire offers inviting spaces to dine, relax, and reconnect, both indoors and out. Solaire isn’t just a yacht, but a celebration of the sun, the sea, and unforgettable charter days spent exactly as they should be.",
